{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"655206","tmdb_id":"movie/655206","media_type":"movie","title":"四渡赤水","original_title":"四渡赤水","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGCw9d0ulDRsNlsjC0MZwkvuY1O.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kggffZlAdxLiN49ZZvcPY2gGkSO.jpg","overview":"遵义会议以后，确定了毛泽东（古月 饰）在红军中的领导地位。1935年1月，正是南方一年中最湿冷的季节，长途跋涉的红军来到赤水河边。前后有敌人的夹击，毛泽东与周恩来（苏林 饰）、刘伯承（傅学成 饰）认真分析敌情，作出一渡赤水入滇。蒋介石（赵恒多 饰）得知派王道之（金安歌 饰）率四十万大军围堵扎西地区，而我红军借敌黔北兵力空虚二渡赤水，巧夺渡口，红军趁敌不备，率精兵奇袭娄山关，挥师遵义，解放了周边广大地区。蒋介石闻听即愤怒又懊恼，他严惩执法不力的军官，再次布重兵追剿红军，准备把红军消灭在乌江岸边，毛泽东审时度势，令红军三渡赤水然后迅速再渡赤水，将敌人远远甩在了身后.....","release_date":"1983-01-01","first_air_date":"","year":"1983","runtime":"156","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":0,"number_of_seasons":0,"genres":["战争","历史"],"languages":["普通话"],"countries":["China"],"tmdb_rating":"6.8 / 10 from 6 users","tmdb_rating_average":6.833,"tmdb_votes":6,"imdb_id":"tt0344331","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0344331/","imdb_rating":"6.4 / 10 from 53 users","imdb_rating_average":"6.4","imdb_votes":"53","directors":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2480611,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"谷德显","original_name":"Gu Dexian","popularity":0.1025,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"5df17ff118b751001440a08b","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2364711,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"蔡继渭","original_name":"Jiwei Cai","popularity":0.1126,"profile_path":"/8grRg01ZRuBiljQZ30gRCWE3BT8.jpg","credit_id":"5df180002cde9800122dfd19","department":"Directing","job":"Director"}],"producers":[],"writers":[],"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":77303,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"王学圻","original_name":"王学圻","popularity":1.3896,"profile_path":"/6ZWonDufaYcVeMmv1ZD8MZZZDeM.jpg","cast_id":6,"character":"","credit_id":"5df17f088d77c40013d8cff4","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1414241,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"古月","original_name":"Gu Yue","popularity":0.2899,"profile_path":"/xPGKP5Yp8J88V0Z01z